sdpa-bwd-pack-strides: oneDNN's pull request #6468 (Barzin, open on 2026-11-09), on v3.14.2, applied by
CMakeLists.txt; #6472 stands on it.

The SDPA's fused backward packs its tensors' strides once, when the primitive is made, not at each run.
